 (text "Camera PoE: 52 V boost (LM5155) and 802.3at PSE (TPS23861, port 1 on the camera jack)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "cbc20b9a-d333-5846-a1ed-ace030e7f859"))
(text "Boost 12-16.8 V -> 52 V, 300 kHz (RT 73.2k), 47 uH XAL7070 (Isat 4.2 A), RS 25 mOhm, RSL 634 Ohm (82 % slope)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "747adac2-10af-54ba-a2c5-7fa862107b0d"))
(text "Current limit about 2.2 A at 12 V in (15 W out with margin); the camera (802.3af) draws about 4 W." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "2193c0fd-fd1e-59bc-9d54-9faf44ae0c1b"))
(text "Loop: crossover about 5 kHz (RHP zero 32 kHz at 15 W), RCOMP 15.8k, CCOMP 10n (zero 1 kHz), CHF 330p." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "ab0de63d-b86e-5b45-bcdc-05052a2e95b4"))
(text "UVLO 56k / 10k: starts at 9.9 V. PGOOD holds the PSE in reset until 52 V is up (TPS23861 VPWR before RESET)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "baffc65e-ef07-5a21-a1ef-f3de138cb76d"))
(text "TPS23861 as shipped: auto mode, I2C 0x28 with A3 open (Jetson I2C1). SDAI and SDAO tied. INT to the expander." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "1ec9a0d4-31bd-5f83-be7f-e696bbcd71ab"))
(text "Port 1 (Alternative A): VPWR on the 1-2 centre tap, switched return on the 3-6 centre tap of J6." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "8328400c-3a81-589c-82fa-5559dc078fe8"))
(text "Ports 2-4 unused: SEN and DRAIN to GND, GATE open (datasheet 8.2.2). Unused camera pairs 4-5, 7-8: Bob Smith." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "e19585f9-d563-5120-a850-090a98ae3dc4"))
